{
  "crash_cause": "UArenaScoreTracker ScoreTracker was a raw pointer (not UPROPERTY), so the garbage collector (412 objects purged before the crash) destroyed it mid-match; the next OnGoalScored dereferenced the stale pointer -> EXCEPTION_ACCESS_VIOLATION at UArenaScoreTracker::AddPoints (ArenaScoreTracker.cpp:18). Fix: store it as UPROPERTY TObjectPtr.",
  "no_colors_cause": "bCookAll=False and only /Game/Data/Effects (plus the Arena map) were cooked, so /Game/Data/Palettes/DA_Primary was never cooked into the package; LoadObject failed, Hud fell back to gray. Fix: add +DirectoriesToAlwaysCook=(Path=\"/Game/Data/Palettes\")."
}
